# Minimal sshd configuration for the XJSM-P12-Z7000 board.
# Written because the stock image ships no sshd_config at all, which leaves
# OpenSSH's built-in PermitRootLogin prohibit-password in force and makes the
# board unreachable except over the serial console.

PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
